#: userland/apps/reliefppt/window.cpp:636
msgid "A native ReliefOS presentation editor.\nDouble-click text to edit. Drag handles to resize.\nF5: present · Ctrl+S: save · Esc: finish editing\nUse .rppt to keep editable slides and embedded pictures."
